{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00574","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享先蚕乐章 肃和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享先蚕乐章 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明灵光至德，深功掩百神。\n祥源应节啓，福绪逐年新。\n万宇承恩覆，七庙伫恭禋。\n于兹申至恳，方期远庆臻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}